      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "すぐそこに停泊しているので\r\n住人も気が気ではなく……",
        "official_en": "Would you believe it? They’ve even had the gall to drop anchor just over yonder. The townsfolk are completely beside themselves with worry.",
        "real_en": "They're anchored so close by that the townspeople are worried sick..."
      },
