      "text": {
        "jp": "なるほど……。\r\nレイン……判断は任せますが\r\n解決したほうがよさそうです。",
        "official_en": "That is disconcerting...\r\nRain, I will leave it to your discretion, but I, for one, believe we should address the matter of these pirates.",
        "real_en": null
