      "text": {
        "jp": "メルセデス海賊団は\r\nこの町の北東の桟橋によく出没します。\r\nどうかお気をつけて。",
        "official_en": "The Mercedes Pirates are often seen docked at the jetty to the northeast of the town. Good luck.",
