      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "守り人様。\r\n近頃、この近辺で「メルセデス海賊団」という\r\n賊の船が出没しております。",
        "official_en": "Warden, sir. The Mercedes Pirates have been prowling the waters nearby.",
        "real_en": "Warden.\r\nLately, ships belonging to the Mercedes Pirates\r\nhave been appearing in these waters."
